      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "With the current audio sources I figure they're ready to play at all times. For swapping them out, could be interesting. Is loading done in the main thread? Does the animation attached to sound clip wait for the audio, or is it out of sync if the computer isn't fast enough with storage?\n\nI've seen some avatars with a few songs and dance routine for each one.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
